      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would absolutely love if the camera and IPD scaled with the avatar in realtime. The old mod \"Scale goes BRR\" accomplished this so hopefully it can be done here too?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
