      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I really want this. I’d recommend it not be default behavior since seeing the world “shrink” might be intensive for people new to VR.\n\nHowever I'm the opposite and the \"sudden change\" from things like holo-port, snap-turning, scale change, or even just when entering or exiting a station, is a bit disorienting.\n\nEven if it doesn't scale live, just seeing it smoothly transition over a second after you chose your new scale would be less jarring to me.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
